<mxCell id="task" value="&lt;b&gt;Illustrative programming request&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Delete database records matching&lt;br&gt;the supplied user identifier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Return the number of deleted records." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacing=20;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;fontSize=25;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#20242A;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="145" width="470" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
